---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="About" description="A technical professional working across systems, infrastructure, AI, automation, and software.">
	<div class="about page">
		<header class="about-header">
			<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
			<h1>Interested in how technology holds together.</h1>
			<p>I'm Huzaifa, a technical professional working where infrastructure, cloud systems, applied AI, automation, developer tooling, and software engineering meet.</p>
		</header>
		<div class="about-body">
			<div class="prose">
				<h2>How I approach the work</h2>
				<p>I am drawn to problems that need both a systems view and attention to the details. The interesting work is rarely confined to one discipline: it asks how the infrastructure behaves, how people use the tools, what can be automated, and where judgment still matters.</p>
				<p>I care about technology that is understandable, resilient, and genuinely useful. That can mean designing a system, improving a developer workflow, testing an AI-enabled process, or making a complex technical decision easier for a team to live with.</p>
				<h2>Areas of practice</h2>
				<ul><li>Infrastructure, cloud, and systems engineering</li><li>AI systems and practical enablement</li><li>Automation and developer tooling</li><li>Solution design, software engineering, and technical leadership</li></ul>
				<h2>Outside the work</h2>
				<p>Linux, developer environments, keyboards, gaming, music, software, and technology more broadly are all part of the same ongoing curiosity. This site is where that curiosity becomes a more durable record.</p>
			</div>
			<aside class="side-note"><p class="meta">This site</p><p>A personal knowledge garden for useful notes, project records, and experiments in public.</p></aside>
		</div>
	</div>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
	.about { padding-top: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 8rem); padding-bottom: 6rem; }
	.about-header { max-width: 49rem; padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
	.about-header h1 { max-width: 13ch; margin: 0.35rem 0 0.8rem; font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.3rem); line-height: 0.93; letter-spacing: -0.075em; }
	.about-header > p:last-child { max-width: 56ch; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.5; }
	.about-body { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 43rem) 14rem; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4rem; }
	.side-note { align-self: start; padding-left: 1rem; border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.5; }
	.side-note p { margin: 0; }.side-note p + p { margin-top: 0.75rem; }
	@media (max-width: 850px) { .about-body { display: block; } .side-note { margin-top: 2rem; } }
</style>
